# Read-only OpenRC observation for a service that is not the SSH session.
# The fixed temporary path keeps the example fully visible in --plan.
# Environment-dependent: requires Alpine Linux with OpenRC, readable cgroup v2
# state, and an active `lighttpd` service.

service status openrc lighttpd
service resources openrc lighttpd
measure service openrc lighttpd for 2s every 1s:
    save to /tmp/yesh-openrc-lighttpd-measure.jsonl
    keep history for 1h
